==Battleground==
*10 [[Doge Dark]]s spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 5.33~16.67 seconds<sup>160f~500f</sup>.
*2 [[Rei (Enemy)|Reis]] (400%) spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Fuu (Enemy)|Fuus]] spawn after 126.67 seconds<sup>3,800f</sup>, delay 40~53.33 seconds<sup>1,200f~1,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Serum (Enemy)|Serums]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Rei (Enemy)|Reis]] (400%) spawn after 113.33 seconds<sup>3,400f</sup>, delay 30~43.33 seconds<sup>900f~1,300f</sup>.
*3 [[Rei (Enemy)|Reis]] (400%) spawn after 113.33 seconds<sup>3,400f</sup>, delay 0.07~1.33 seconds<sup>2f~40f</sup>.
*3 [[Serum (Enemy)|Serums]] spawn after 113.33 seconds<sup>3,400f</sup>, delay 0.67~3.33 seconds<sup>20f~100f</sup>.
*1 [[Wyvern (Enemy)|Wyvern]] spawns after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>.
*1 [[Wyvern (Enemy)|Wyvern]] spawns after 120 seconds<sup>3,600f</sup>.
*1 [[Healer (Enemy)|Healer]] spawns as the boss after 113.33 seconds<sup>3,400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 50% HP:
**1 [[Wyvern (Enemy)|Wyvern]] spawns.
**1 [[Rei (Enemy)|Rei]] (100%) spawns.

==Strategy==
Besides Wyvern, all the enemies here have a short range, so high DPS melee attackers work well against them. For Wyvern, time A. Bahamut to hit between attacks. This is the best option unless you have a unit that outranges Wyvern. Anti-Floating units work wonders in this stage.

==Trivia==
*This is the only stage in the [[Merc Storia Collaboration Event]] to feature a non-collab enemy, namely featuring [[Doge Dark]].

